07_1351545363214646_5506338495222860567_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=frW8jbyzsMgQ7kNvwFeNxE4&_nc_oc=AdquUqUzjJROxHUeFBCrrVI-tbHUMjglcgYPl1kaWEsMPDc7DkUPcw6ScvZFqPH1XX8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFhnKynqCS4DC1wbD3Kv_0eUm5QXXwRdFVNa-QMDNG3gA&oe=6A773AC2"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p4G8zknSACgQ7kNvwFrgoh_&_nc_oc=Adr7RC1GjsiStXGMP1QliN370VEtn_Cpsg7l0qNV4kF7MjbLuCEum8SX_GU0VdTOjsg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEIIT4H44wiBWl-6pvMHE9x-6rYN892wjl5jhkcadu4-w&oe=6A77303F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sWW2tjxlp6sQ7kNvwGuIBr-&_nc_oc=AdpgCUi9tHHTnAEXuH1PVKbJsae1Ob3Yxs2LXSlNY78SVJoRNC_gjXSmyfkZKYmOdwo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHKuVlJh_P642dtKi0wSiQwpS-CNWR3MZst913b4yZRNg&oe=6A773F30"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quic